  text 0 "@^The ship escapes the exploding planet and heads home..."
  script
        PlayAudio 26
        ScreenShake 0, 8, 160
        WaitFrames 150
        PlayAudio 50
  text 0 "@^The ship lands back at Capsule Corp."
