  text 36 "BULMA: You're back!  What happened out there?"
  text 73 "KRILLIN: Long story.  New Planet Vegeta was a trap...\x0band the guy waiting for us there was a monster."
  text 2 "GOHAN: He kept calling me Kakarot.  He really hated my dad."
  text 5 "TRUNKS: If that's what a Legendary Super Saiyan is like...\x0bI hope we never meet another one."
  text 3 "PICCOLO: Then we keep training.  Something worse is always coming."
  text 4 "VEGETA: Hmph.  A Legendary Super Saiyan...  and I sent him to the grave.  Remember that."
  script
        FadeOut 120
        WaitFrames 60
        DespawnEntity 24
        PushActiveCharIndex
        PushByte 2
        CmpNe
        CoopCall 8, 0, 0, 0
        PushByte 2
        CmpNe
        And
        JumpIfFalse N24
        DespawnEntity 137
      N24:
        PushActiveCharIndex
        PushByte 3
        CmpNe
